  <Placemark>
   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued November 7 at 8:36AM EST until November 9 at 6:00AM EST by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...West winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt.

* WHERE...Chesapeake Bay and adjoining estuaries north of Smith
Point VA, and Tidal Potomac from Cobb Island MD to Smith Point
VA.

* WHEN...Until 6 AM EST Monday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
