   <name>Marine Weather Statement issued November 7 at 8:24AM EST by NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>A brief surge of strong northerly winds gusting to near 30 knots
is approaching eastern NC waters. Winds should start coming back
down again around 12 PM.</Snippet>
