   <Snippet>* WHAT...For the first Small Craft Advisory, southeast winds 20
to 30 kt with gusts up to 40 kt and seas 10 to 12 ft. For the
Gale Warning, east winds 30 to 40 kt with gusts up to 55 kt
and seas 13 to 18 ft expected. For the second Small Craft
Advisory, west winds 20 to 30 kt with gusts up to 40 kt and
seas 10 to 15 ft expected.

* WHERE...Dixon Entrance to Cape Decision from 15 to 90 NM.

