today. For the Gale Warning, from noon today to 9 PM AKST this
evening. For the second Small Craft Advisory, from 9 PM this
evening to 6 PM AKST Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous seas which could
capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.</Snippet>
